<title>THAILAND: US soybean board sees 3 bln bushel output in 2005.</title>
<headline>US soybean board sees 3 bln bushel output in 2005.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean production is expected to reach three billion bushels by the year 2005, half of which will be exported, United Soybean Board International Marketing Chairman Douglas Magnus said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
